WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.503
Dry-running a loop in your head

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.578
feels like a maze.

00:00:04.578 --> 00:00:08.728
The fix: a trace table, one

00:00:08.728 --> 00:00:11.103
iteration per row.

00:00:12.503 --> 00:00:13.303
Trace it.

00:00:13.003 --> 00:00:14.328
Then trust it.

00:00:14.919 --> 00:00:16.769
Step through algorithms in Placiq.
